Third-party / derived code
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The classes in the package `no.tine.xp.lib.freemarker.view` and its
sub-package `no.tine.xp.lib.freemarker.view.impl` are derived from
Enonic's lib-thymeleaf project:

    https://github.com/enonic/lib-thymeleaf

lib-thymeleaf is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

    Copyright Enonic AS

These files were adapted (the package was renamed from
`com.enonic.lib.thymeleaf.view` to `no.tine.xp.lib.freemarker.view`) to
provide the portal view-function support that was previously supplied by
`com.enonic.xp.portal.view.ViewFunctionService`. That service was removed
from Enonic XP core in XP 8, so an equivalent implementation is now
bundled with this library.

